        "quote": "The Federal Clean Water Act, 33 U.S.C. Section 1251 et seq., requires certain political entities, such as the City, to implement stormwater management programs within prescribed time frames.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.25.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
